{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magitech Requiem is a modern evolution of classic arcade shooters. Build your character through leveling, perks, and Magitech. Take up arms and fight the forces of uncreation, be it alone or with up to two friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an alternate history, an incredible force known as Quintessence was discovered by alchemical practitioners in 198X. Shortly after the discovery of\u00a0Quintessence, novel technologies termed 'Magitech' were developed for use in the industrial, scientific, and medical industries. But before Magitech could reach its full potential, mankind's hubris invoked the hunger of an otherworldly legion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a Defier, you fight against entropy itself. Do you and your comrades have the grit to overcome the great filter?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rookie Defier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2869600/14633eb70a7fefa06680cabd435ef01509058d9d.jpg"},{"name":"Experienced Defier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2869600/b7fd944bc887505a77c978979a3721cb0bafaaf3.jpg"},{"name":"Stunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2869600/480868c61a1f507a7222cd6a0b5ab74bc6beacfd.jpg"},{"name":"Set up them the bomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2869600/e33ea90d2066f333c53ca05b102ea814a1d3bbb0.jpg"},{"name":"Tis' but a Scratch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2869600/bfb95d2a8b76ad745f4efb2d797bdd189d04e5fa.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2869600?t=1744121951","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2869600?t=1744121951","capsule_image":"https://shared.aka